                                "sense_id": "4818a121-7c36-3a24-ae96-04927ca662a3",
                                "text": "Now they can no more hear thy ghittern’s tune, / For venturing syllables that ill beseem / The quiet glooms of such a piteous theme."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
